      "message": "yeah, of course, i ever considered if this code block can be removed.\n\nin earlier CDMA (before CDMA2000), MIN should be used only, so in general, IMSI \u003d mcc + mnc + min is used to compatiable with GSM for roaming.\n\nbut in CDMA2000, EF_CSIM_IMSIM shoulb be present always.\n\nin order to keep compatiable and avoid risks, i leave the API usage",
